    {
      "id": "86b1921f-efa7-410f-92dd-79553bf3264d",
      "type": "notebook",
      "properties": {
        "showToolbar": true,
        "content": "<h2><strong>Welcome to IDOML Dashboard 🚀👋</strong></h2><p>We're glad that you're here! IDOML is a <em>modern </em>and <em>easy to use</em> platform that helps you to <strong>build and deploy</strong> your ML project from scratch to versioned pipeline.</p><p>We recommend you to read the platform documentation for end user <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://serval-uni-lu.github.io/idoml-docs/enduser/get-started/\">here</a>, which will give you a basic understanding of the platform. Follow the steps below to get started with IDOML, which will guide you through the process of creating a new project, training a model, and deploying it.</p><p></p><p><strong><u>Your getting started list:</u></strong></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Read the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://serval-uni-lu.github.io/idoml-docs/enduser/get-started/\">end user documentation</a></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Setting up your credentials</p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Github tokens</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Minio Access Keys</p></div></li></ul></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Configure IDOML runtime with Elyra inside Jupyterhub server</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Clone experimental pipeline with turorial example</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Submit pipeline to airflow</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p></p>"  
      },
